    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      262.97,
      401.89,
      286.31
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      298.97,
      401.89,
      322.31
    ],
    "text": "1. This Act may be cited as the Registration of Documents(Amendment) Act, No. of 2022.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      334.97,
      401.88,
      370.31
    ],
    "text": "2. Section 32 of the Registration of Documents Ordinance(Chapter 117) (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipalenactment\u201d) is hereby amended as follows:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      173.61,
      382.97,
      401.86,
      406.31
    ],
    "text": "(1) by the repeal of subsection (1) thereof and thesubstitution therefor of the following subsection: -",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      193.05,
      418.97,
      401.88,
      442.31
    ],
    "text": "\u201c(1) (a) A person (hereinafter referred to as the\u201ccaveator\u201d) who",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      237.81,
      454.97,
      371.15,
      466.31
    ],
    "text": "(i) has a right, title or interest; or",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      234.81,
      478.97,
      401.88,
      490.31
    ],
    "text": "(ii) claims to have a right, title or interest,",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      227.85,
      502.97,
      401.89,
      598.31
    ],
    "text": "to a land, an undivided land, a land parcel ora condominium parcel (hereinafter in thissection referred to as the \u201cland\u201d) may presentfor registration a caveat substantially inForm VIII of the Second Schedule heretorequiring him to be served a notice of thepresentation for registration of anyinstrument affecting such land.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      212.61,
      610.97,
      401.86,
      622.31
    ],
    "text": "(b) Every caveat presented for registration shall\u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      233.85,
      634.97,
      401.87,
      670.43
    ],
    "text": "(i) be in duplicate and accompanied by anaffidavit of the caveator together with acertificate issued by an Attorney-at-law",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      336.07,
      455.86,
      373.94
    ],
    "text": "Amendmentof section 32of Chapter117",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      144.57,
      659.93,
      155.01,
      671.27
    ],
    "text": "25",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
